 "secondary_motion": [],
 "silhouette_notes": "Big circle (helmet) on a rounded box (suit + pack) on two stubby legs. The light-blue visor is the only cool colour, so the face area reads even at 32 px; orange gloves/bands mark the limbs during motion. White suit needs the dark outline on every edge or it vanishes on light backgrounds.",
 "animation_notes": "Zero secondary motion; liveliness comes from squash/bob of the whole body and a slight helmet lag (rigid, 1-frame delay). Walk is a waddle, easy and charming at chibi.",
 "risks": [
  "White-on-white interior lines (suit vs backpack) need the shade tone, not outline, to stay clean",
  "Visor glint can flicker; keep it fixed to the helmet"
 ]
}